# Pairs with NoEarlyGraceRelease. The grace may end early only once every silo
# membership lists has leased from the new activation, or has been seen dead for
# one lease plus the margin; the mutant releases it while a silo still holds a
# lease from the old one.
MODULE: ReleaseGraceEarly
TARGET: NoEarlyGraceRelease
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grace is released before every silo has leased afresh or aged out
PERTURBS: ReleaseGrace
BOUNDS: MaxRestarts = 1

--- FIND
    /\ \A t \in Silos : ~awaiting[t] /\ (LeasedHere(t) \/ (MemberDead(t) /\ seen[t] = "aged"))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the release check is dropped.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
